":{"r1":-0.0141,"r5":0.0266,"r20":0.0236,"r1_spy":-0.0094,"r5_spy":0.0403,"r20_spy":0.0435}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ACM 2017 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2017-11-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Burke","x":"In response to some of these dynamics, we are taking measured actions to streamline a few of our operations to better align our overhead and to deliver work more efficiently.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/14/aecom-technology-acm-q4-2017-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2017 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2017-11-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Troy Rudd","x":"I should note that our guidance includes between 20 and 25 million dollars of expected restructuring charges to reduce overhead and drive efficiencies across businesses which Mike spoke to earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/14/aecom-technology-acm-q4-2017-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2018 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2018-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"W Troy Rudd","x":"With respect to the impacts of the G&A reduction plan, we expect to incur approximately $80-90 million of restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/12/aecom-technology-acm-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2018 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2018-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Burke","x":"With this restructuring and streamlined cost structure, we will have seven percent margins in the DCS business, and so, what that means is that the growth that we've had in the DCS business, you heard us mention the double-digit organic growth in the second half of the year in DCS, the $54…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/12/aecom-technology-acm-q4-2018-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Troy Rudd","x":"Andy, so as you pointed out, we are ahead of the pace we said we'd be in terms of completing the restructuring, and we will see the impact of that in our design business in the second quarter, so margins will improve.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/aecom-technology-acm-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2019-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Troy Rudd","x":"In terms of the balance, again, as Mike pointed out in his prepared comments, that we have actually undertaken restructuring in the U.K. to position ourselves for the softness in that market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/aecom-technology-acm-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2019-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Troy Rudd","x":"As a result, we have reaffirmed our guidance, include our expectation for revenue growth, 12% adjusted EBITDA growth at the midpoint of our guidance range and $600 million to $800 million of free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/aecom-technology-acm-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2019-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Troy Rudd","x":"We're reiterating our full year guidance of $600 million to $800 million of free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/06/aecom-technology-acm-q1-2019-earnings-conference-c.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q3","e":"acm","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Burke","x":"We will continue to benefit from the professional services nature of this work, that provides for a low risk profile, high margins on revenue after excluding pass-through costs and generates our highest return on capital.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/aecom-acm-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q3","e":"acm","d":"2019-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"W. Troy Rudd","x":"Recall this business include substantial pass through cost in the building construction business that dilute the margin percentage on a gross revenue basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/aecom-acm-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q3","e":"acm","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Will Gabrielski","x":"Today's call includes comments about restructuring activities that are expected to commence later this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/aecom-acm-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q3","e":"acm","d":"2019-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Burke","x":"…more apparent than in our plan to separate the Management Services segment, the near record DCS margin resulting from the restructuring actions we executed in the first half of the year, and in our ongoing commitment to focus on our higher margin and lower risk professional services businesses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/06/aecom-acm-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2019-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"W. Troy Rudd","x":"As a reminder, our construction management business, which comprises approximately 70% of the revenue in this segment, contains a high level of pass-through revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/aecom-acm-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2019-11-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chad Dillard","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/aecom-acm-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Burke","x":"Third, the restructuring actions we have taken and continue to take are resulting in record profitability, including an all-time high DCS margin in the fourth quarter and for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/aecom-acm-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2019 Q4","e":"acm","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Burke","x":"We executed a $225 million restructuring plan during 2019, and we announced additional restructuring actions in August.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/aecom-acm-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2020 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2020-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Chad Dillard","x":"Thanks, I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/aecom-acm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2020 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2020-02-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Kaplowitz","x":"And then how quickly it could get there given the consolidation of your geographic footprint, the additional restructuring you're doing?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/aecom-acm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2020 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2020-02-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael S. Burke","x":"Building on last year's momentum, adjusted EBITDA increased by 27% in the first quarter and we reiterated guidance for 12% EBITDA growth at the midpoint of our 2020 guidance range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/aecom-acm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2020 Q1","e":"acm","d":"2020-02-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"W. Troy Rudd","x":"As a result, we are reaffirming our guidance for $100 million to $300 million of free cash flow this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/03/aecom-acm-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ACM 2020 Q2","e":"acm","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"W. Troy Rudd","x":"Second, we incurred cash restructuring costs of approximately $40 million in the quarter as part of 